### 7.3 API 엔드포인트 목록

| Method           | Endpoint                                 | Hook                              |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| **Auth**         |
| POST             | `/auth/register`                         | `useRegister()`                   |
| POST             | `/auth/login`                            | `useLogin()`                      |
| GET              | `/auth/me`                               | `useMe()`                         |
| **Projects**     |
| GET              | `/projects`                              | `useProjects()`                   |
| POST             | `/projects`                              | `useCreateProject()`              |
| GET              | `/projects/:id`                          | `useProject(id)`                  |
| **Locales**      |
| GET              | `/projects/:id/locales`                  | `useLocales(projectId)`           |
| POST             | `/projects/:id/locales`                  | `useCreateLocale()`               |
| PATCH            | `/projects/:id/locales/:localeId/status` | `useUpdateLocaleStatus()`         |
| **Keys**         |
| GET              | `/projects/:id/keys`                     | `useKeys(projectId)`              |
| POST             | `/projects/:id/keys`                     | `useCreateKey()`                  |
| **Translations** |
| GET              | `/projects/:id/translations/matrix`      | `useTranslationMatrix(projectId)` |
| PATCH            | `/projects/:id/translations`             | `useUpdateTranslations()`         |

